## Throwaway diagnostic tests. Convention: a review or debugging pass that writes a
## test purely to demonstrate a defect names it ZZProbe_*, so it is obviously scratch
## and trivially removable. These are expected to FAIL while the defect is open, so
## they must never be committed — a probe that proves its point gets rewritten as a
## properly-named permanent regression test in the normal suite instead.
Gravity-gen2.Tests/**/ZZProbe_*.cs
